
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:epub="http://www.idpf.org/2007/ops" lang="en-US" xml:lang="en-US" epub:prefix="storyteller: https://storyteller-platform.dev/docs/vocabulary">
  <head>
    <title>Chapter 1, Black Powder War</title>
    <meta charset="utf-8"/>
    <link href="../css/prh_resets.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css"/>
